Dear Parnell Springmeyer,

Thanks for your contribution!

Your e-mail contained 3 patches sent as attachment. They should be sent
inline. To do this, please use git send-email.

Also, your 3 patches should in fact be merged into one: they just add a
new package, and they are all needed together for the package to work.
To merge your three patches into one, search the Web for "git
interactive rebase". It will allow to reorganize your Git commits
before generating the patches.

I'll mark your patches as "Changes Requested" in our patch tracking
system, so please resubmit a new version once you've addressed the
above issues.

Thanks a lot!

